# Commands run by the launchd job com.hakios.demo (RC_JOBS=rc.jobs.netopen).
# The owner's black with the network on: the scene joins Wi-Fi itself (the same net_test lines
# rc.jobs.sileo uses) and then opens Sileo, so its launch does its repository work while the
# screen is watched. The runner is devices/thyme/launchtest.sh
# (SCENE=out/thyme-boot/root-netopen.apfs), a screenshot every two seconds; the window
# server's audit says whether the display was opaque black.
/redwood/bin/rwtouch wait 30 swipe 0.5 0.985 0.5 0.3 200 wait 6
/redwood/bin/net_test joinfile /redwood/fw/network
/redwood/bin/net_test waitaddr en0 60 resolve apt.procurs.us
/var/jb/usr/bin/uiopen sileo://package/tree
/redwood/bin/rwtouch wait 60
